%% RF-04 Créditos y Documentos - Secuencia (generar contrato PDF)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor CLI as Cliente
    participant UI as /dashboard/documentos
    participant API as /api/documentos/contrato
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant PDF as lib/pdf.js (Puppeteer)

    CLI->>UI: "Descargar contrato"
    UI->>API: GET contrato?id_credito
    API->>DB: SELECT credito + plan_pago + cuota + cliente
    DB-->>API: Datos del crédito
    API->>PDF: Renderizar plantilla HTML → PDF
    PDF-->>API: Buffer PDF
    API->>DB: INSERT log_descarga_documento
    API-->>UI: 200 (application/pdf)
    UI-->>CLI: Descarga del archivo
